### 3. Non-Hosting & Third-Party Content Disclaimer (DMCA & Safe Harbor)
**SnapFlix operates strictly as a client-side user interface and indexer:**
- **Zero Content Hosting:** SnapFlix and its Owner do **NOT** host, upload, archive, store, manage, encode, or transmit any video, audio, media files, or copyrighted material on any of their servers or databases.
- **Third-Party Servers:** All media streams, video segments, subtitles, and external data indexed or accessed through the Software are hosted and served exclusively by independent, third-party internet hosting services over which Farhan Ansari and SnapFlix exercise zero control, ownership, or operational relationship.
- **Search & Discovery Functionality:** The Software functions solely as a client-side search aggregator and user agent that visualizes publicly available streaming endpoints available across the open internet.
- **No Affiliation:** SnapFlix is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or associated with any third-party stream hosts, media networks, or content producers. All trademarks, service marks, and trade names referenced belong to their respective owners.

### 4. Copyright & DMCA Takedown Notices
Because SnapFlix does not host or store any media files on its servers, the Owner does not have the technical ability or legal jurisdiction to remove content hosted on external third-party servers. Copyright holders requesting the removal of specific media files must direct their requests to the actual web hosting services storing the content.

